    <guid isPermaLink="false">https://alqaryangroup.com/?page_id=1024</guid>
    <description></description>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:html -->

<header class="q-site-head">
  <div class="q-site-head__inner">
    <a class="q-brand" href="/">
      <span class="q-brand__mark">AQ</span>
      <span class="q-brand__name">Al Qaryan <em>Industries</em></span>
    </a>
    <nav class="q-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="/services/">Services</a>
      <a href="/materials-we-deal/">Materials We Deal</a>
      <a href="/we-buy/">We Buy Scrap</a>
      <a href="/facility/">Facility</a>
      <a href="/quality/">Quality</a>
      <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>
      <a class="q-nav__cta" href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="q-hero q-hero--compact">
  <p class="q-kicker">Materials · PET</p>
  <h1>PET flakes</h1>
  <p class="q-lead">Washed polyethylene terephthalate bottle flakes for fibre, sheet and strapping producers.</p>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Where our PET comes from</h2>
  <p>Bottle scrap collected from established markets and verified local supply, sorted by colour, stripped of caps and labels, washed and dried.</p>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Specification and ordering</h2>
  <table class="q-table">
    <tbody>
  <tr><th>Form</th><td>Washed flake (pellets on request, subject to run)</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Colour</th><td>Clear, light blue, mixed — depending on the collection</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Grade</th><td>Agreed per lot: intended application, residual moisture and contamination stated</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Packing</th><td>Jumbo bags or 25 kg bags</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Minimum order</th><td>One truckload</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Documents</th><td>Batch test report; SGS on request</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Typical applications</h2>
  <p>Polyester fibre, strapping, sheet and thermoformed packaging.</p>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Questions buyers ask</h2>
  <details class="q-faq"><summary>Which colours are available?</summary><p>It follows the collection: clear and light blue are common, mixed is available when the price matters more than the colour.</p></details>
  <details class="q-faq"><summary>What is the moisture content?</summary><p>Dried before dispatch and checked. The figure for the lot is on the batch report — fibre producers usually ask for it before confirming.</p></details>
</div>


<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Grades and scrap streams for this material</h2>
  <p>Each stream has its own page covering the grades we buy and sell, the specification we work to, the contamination that matters, and how we process it.</p>
  <div class="q-grid q-grid--3">
  <div class="q-card"><h3>PET bottle scrap</h3><p>Baled bottles and washed flake for fibre and sheet</p><a class="q-link" href="/materials-we-deal/pet-bottle-scrap/">PET bottle scrap</a></div>
  <div class="q-card"><h3>Prime materials</h3><p>Virgin bottle-grade resin with full documentation</p><a class="q-link" href="/materials-we-deal/prime-materials/">Prime materials</a></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="q-cta">
  <div class="q-cta__text">
    <strong>Buying this material, or selling it to us?</strong>
    <span>Send the grade, the quantity and your city — we reply with availability and price.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="q-cta__actions">
    <a class="q-btn q-btn--primary" href="/contact/">Request a quote</a>
    <a class="q-btn q-btn--wa" href="https://wa.me/923332010506" rel="noopener" target="_blank">WhatsApp +92 333 201 0506</a>
  </div>
</div>

