    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:html -->

<header class="q-site-head">
  <div class="q-site-head__inner">
    <a class="q-brand" href="/">
      <span class="q-brand__mark">AQ</span>
      <span class="q-brand__name">Al Qaryan <em>Industries</em></span>
    </a>
    <nav class="q-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="/services/">Services</a>
      <a href="/materials-we-deal/">Materials We Deal</a>
      <a href="/we-buy/">We Buy Scrap</a>
      <a href="/facility/">Facility</a>
      <a href="/quality/">Quality</a>
      <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>
      <a class="q-nav__cta" href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="q-hero q-hero--compact">
  <p class="q-kicker">Materials · PVC</p>
  <h1>PVC regrind and compound</h1>
  <p class="q-lead">Rigid PVC recovered from pipe, profile and window scrap — processed into regrind and compound, including the material that feeds our own pipe lines.</p>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Where our PVC comes from</h2>
  <p>Pipe offcuts, profile scrap and window sections from established markets and verified local suppliers. PVC is harder to recycle cleanly than polyolefins — it needs careful separation from other polymers — which is exactly why we process it in-house rather than buy it at arm's length.</p>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Specification and ordering</h2>
  <table class="q-table">
    <tbody>
  <tr><th>Form</th><td>Regrind or compound</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Colour</th><td>White, grey, mixed, or matched to requirement</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Grade</th><td>Agreed per lot against your application</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Packing</th><td>25 kg bags or jumbo bags</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Minimum order</th><td>One truckload</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Documents</th><td>Batch test report; SGS on request</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Typical applications</h2>
  <p>Rigid pipe, conduit, profiles, and moulded fittings.</p>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Questions buyers ask</h2>
  <details class="q-faq"><summary>Is the PVC separated from other polymers?</summary><p>Yes. Rigid PVC is separated before processing; mixing PVC with polyolefins would ruin both. Separation is a step we control, not something we outsource.</p></details>
  <details class="q-faq"><summary>Do you supply pipe-grade compound?</summary><p>Yes — that is the same material stream that feeds our own extrusion lines, which is the most demanding test of it.</p></details>
</div>


<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Grades and scrap streams for this material</h2>
  <p>Each stream has its own page covering the grades we buy and sell, the specification we work to, the contamination that matters, and how we process it.</p>
  <div class="q-grid q-grid--3">
  <div class="q-card"><h3>PVC pipe scrap</h3><p>Rigid uPVC drainage, sewer and conduit pipe</p><a class="q-link" href="/materials-we-deal/pvc-pipe-scrap/">PVC pipe scrap</a></div>
  <div class="q-card"><h3>UPVC profile scrap</h3><p>Window and door profile scrap</p><a class="q-link" href="/materials-we-deal/upvc-profile-scrap/">UPVC profile scrap</a></div>
  <div class="q-card"><h3>PVC cable scrap</h3><p>Plasticised PVC from wire and cable</p><a class="q-link" href="/materials-we-deal/pvc-cable-scrap/">PVC cable scrap</a></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="q-cta">
  <div class="q-cta__text">
    <strong>Buying this material, or selling it to us?</strong>
    <span>Send the grade, the quantity and your city — we reply with availability and price.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="q-cta__actions">
    <a class="q-btn q-btn--primary" href="/contact/">Request a quote</a>
    <a class="q-btn q-btn--wa" href="https://wa.me/923332010506" rel="noopener" target="_blank">WhatsApp +92 333 201 0506</a>
  </div>
</div>

