    <title><![CDATA[ABS & PS Regrind]]></title>
    <link>https://alqaryangroup.com/abs-ps/</link>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator><![CDATA[qaryan_admin]]></dc:creator>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">https://alqaryangroup.com/?page_id=1026</guid>
    <description></description>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:html -->

<header class="q-site-head">
  <div class="q-site-head__inner">
    <a class="q-brand" href="/">
      <span class="q-brand__mark">AQ</span>
      <span class="q-brand__name">Al Qaryan <em>Industries</em></span>
    </a>
    <nav class="q-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="/services/">Services</a>
      <a href="/materials-we-deal/">Materials We Deal</a>
      <a href="/we-buy/">We Buy Scrap</a>
      <a href="/facility/">Facility</a>
      <a href="/quality/">Quality</a>
      <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>
      <a class="q-nav__cta" href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="q-hero q-hero--compact">
  <p class="q-kicker">Materials · ABS &amp; PS</p>
  <h1>ABS and PS regrind</h1>
  <p class="q-lead">Acrylonitrile butadiene styrene and polystyrene recovered from electronics, appliances and packaging, processed for moulding.</p>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Where it comes from</h2>
  <p>Electronics housings, appliance components and packaging recovered from established markets and verified local supply. These streams need careful sorting by polymer and colour before processing, which is where most of the value is added.</p>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Specification and ordering</h2>
  <table class="q-table">
    <tbody>
      <tr><th>Form</th><td>Regrind or pellets (subject to run)</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Colour</th><td>Black, white, grey, mixed</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Grade</th><td>Agreed per lot against your application</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Packing</th><td>25 kg bags or jumbo bags</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Minimum order</th><td>One truckload</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Documents</th><td>Batch test report; SGS on request</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Typical applications</h2>
  <p>Injection-moulded housings, appliance parts, general goods and packaging components.</p>
</div>

<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Questions buyers ask</h2>
  <details class="q-faq"><summary>Is ABS and PS supplied separately?</summary><p>Yes. They are different polymers with different properties and are kept separate through sorting.</p></details>
  <details class="q-faq"><summary>Can you match a specific colour?</summary><p>Black, white and grey are the most reliable. For other colours, tell us the requirement and we will confirm what the collection allows.</p></details>
</div>


<div class="q-section">
  <h2>Grades and scrap streams for this material</h2>
  <p>Each stream has its own page covering the grades we buy and sell, the specification we work to, the contamination that matters, and how we process it.</p>
  <div class="q-grid q-grid--3">
  <div class="q-card"><h3>PC bottle scrap</h3><p>Polycarbonate water bottles recycled into engineering applications</p><a class="q-link" href="/materials-we-deal/pc-bottle-scrap/">PC bottle scrap</a></div>
  <div class="q-card"><h3>Off-grade materials</h3><p>Alternative resin grades in bulk</p><a class="q-link" href="/materials-we-deal/off-grade-materials/">Off-grade materials</a></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="q-cta">
  <div class="q-cta__text">
    <strong>Buying this material, or selling it to us?</strong>
    <span>Send the grade, the quantity and your city — we reply with availability and price.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="q-cta__actions">
    <a class="q-btn q-btn--primary" href="/contact/">Request a quote</a>
    <a class="q-btn q-btn--wa" href="https://wa.me/923332010506" rel="noopener" target="_blank">WhatsApp +92 333 201 0506</a>
  </div>
</div>

