ence between PE100 and PE100-RC?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PE100-RC is PE100 with much greater resistance to slow crack growth. It is specified for trenchless installation, rocky backfill or rough handling, because it tolerates the surface scratches that would shorten the life of standard PE100."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you supply HDPE pipe outside Karachi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — we deliver across Pakistan. Send the delivery location with your enquiry and we will confirm freight and lead time along with the price."}}]}
